{
  "id": "cloud-aws-sso",
  "workdir": "/home/student/sso",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "vars": {},
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/sso/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{ss0_p3rm1ss10n_s3t}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/sso",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/sso/task.md",
      "text": "# Задача: AWS SSO\n\nРазбери permission sets Identity Center. Найди избыточные права и флаг.\n\nИнструмент: `aws` (эмуляция).\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/sso/notes.md",
      "text": "Заметки\n------\n- IAM Identity Center раздаёт доступ через permission sets.\n- AdministratorAccess permission set = вход в аккаунт с полными правами.\n"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "aws": {
      "help": "aws sso-admin <...> — AWS CLI (эмуляция)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "list-permission-sets",
          "example": "aws sso-admin list-permission-sets --instance-arn arn:aws:sso:::instance/ssoins-123",
          "output": "{\"PermissionSets\": [\"ps-aaa111\", \"ps-bbb222\", \"ps-ccc333\"]}\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "describe-permission-set",
          "example": "aws sso-admin describe-permission-set --instance-arn arn:aws:sso:::instance/ssoins-123 --permission-set-arn arn:aws:sso:::permissionSet/ssoins-123/ps-bbb222",
          "output": "{\n  \"PermissionSet\": {\n    \"Name\": \"AcmeAdmin\",\n    \"Description\": \"full admin, flag=nto{ss0_p3rm1ss10n_s3t}\",\n    \"SessionDuration\": \"PT8H\"\n  }\n}\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "aws: (эмуляция) такой вызов не захвачен. Попробуй:\n  aws sso-admin list-permission-sets --instance-arn arn:aws:sso:::instance/ssoins-123\n"
    }
  }
}
